[{"title":"绀圃即事","author":"真可","text":"小居在旷野，寂无尘俗想。\n疏钟深夜闻，六根泻清响。\n昼读天竺书，幽窗思忽晃。\n犬吠桃花阴，麦浪人来往。\n最爱晚雨晴，空林返照爽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":365,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潭柘怀缪仲淳","author":"真可","text":"谷水龙泉一片云，去来谁复见离群。\n夜深唯有沧溟月，无限清光不可分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":366,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结夏金坛之北园兼怀候铁庵","author":"真可","text":"纳凉何必独夫容，水木清幽趣亦同。\n世上共高肥马价，林间单放病僧慵。\n苔痕鹤过偶成字，月影鱼吞不解空。\n更忆澹虚亭上梦，寒云片片岭头逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":367,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴氏废园二首 其一","author":"真可","text":"汾阳门第晋风流，缥缈湖山感胜游。\n今日松萝谁是主，断云残月锁江楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":368,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴氏废园二首 其二","author":"真可","text":"筑成金屋贮婵娟，草魇花迷知几年。\n愁见向来歌舞地，古槎疏柳起寒烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":369,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璃璃灯","author":"真可","text":"谁把冰轮掷下方，老禅拈取挂虚堂。\n升沈虽复凭他力，内外从来本自光。\n未点金容犹冷淡，才然宝座愈辉煌。\n莫将龙烛堪相比，不照人王照法王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":370,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下偶成","author":"真可","text":"静夜无云月正中，清光何处不相同。\n江南江北闲台殿，几个心闻晓寺钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":371,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天目山活埋庵","author":"真可","text":"自古名高累不轻，饮牛终是上流清。\n吾师未死先埋却，又向巢由顶上行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":372,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼高峰祖师塔","author":"真可","text":"二十馀年抱死关，那来魂梦落青山。\n临行白骨无藏处，掷向金毛舌上安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":373,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跛法师歌","author":"祩宏","text":"跛脚法师胡以名，良由能说不能行。\n我今行说两俱拙，不应无实当斯称。\n春王正月才过十，午间随例入浴室。\n失足俄沉百沸汤，不起床敷五十日。\n疮痍甫平筋力疲，左长右短行参差。\n东行夹辅二童子，西行交倚双筇枝。\n是故此师名跛脚，跛去跛来人笑杀。\n笑杀平生好放生，善因恶果理难合。\n颇有市肆旃陀罗，刲羊击牛烹凫鹅。\n鳖鳝蟹蛤杀无数，而反康豫无纤疴。\n放生诚有长寿理，因果无差休乱拟。\n我昔杀业今须偿，身痛心生大欢喜。\n傍人问我喜者何，我以此脚成蹉跎。\n趋奔无始至今日，步步趁入无明窠。\n或趋名兮据高位，冲寒踏遍金阶地。\n或趋利兮走天涯，历尽燕秦并楚魏。\n或趋势豪候门墙，不减立雪之游扬。\n或趋女色越垣阃，繇此暮夜遭伤亡。\n或趋檀施求无已，匍匐泥涂没其趾。\n或趋友朋时往来，破夏践殒诸虫蚁。\n或趋五岳及三山，南驰北骛芒鞋穿。\n所以如来苦呵责，举足动足皆冤愆。\n幸哉今跛损成益，思欲闲行行不得。\n潜踪敛迹守林峦，多种狂心一朝息。\n客来恕我不起延，兀兀似入磨砖禅。\n闭门无事且高枕，欲学翠色烟岚眠。\n只愁此脚不终疾，趋奔万境仍如昔。\n愿君不跛如跛人，胜彼长年掩关客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":374,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送界公还海虞","author":"洪恩","text":"寒云江上渡，去住总超伦。\n落尽风鸣叶，窥残月傍人。\n下签诸品彻，析难一言申。\n映带河山色，孤帆处处新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":375,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过安茂卿秦淮寓馆","author":"洪恩","text":"安期东海至，新借白门居。\n绿醑称从事，红妆用校书。\n舟移淮水月，馔出晋陵鱼。\n闻道西林胜，能无一榻虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":376,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同定源过云西别馆夜坐","author":"洪恩","text":"一水云西紫翠阴，为园虽小自开林。\n径饶黄菊聊供采，门掩苍山岂事寻。\n明月半残今夜色，寒灯犹吐十年心。\n坐中且莫言摇落，世路浮名真陆沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":377,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊慈姥矶登绝顶坐月","author":"洪恩","text":"踪迹元蓬蔂，天涯自往回。\n秋风随去棹，夜色共登台。\n石面潮初落，江头月正来。\n最高思欲卧，清磬一声催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":378,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上道中即事有怀同社诸友","author":"洪恩","text":"遵路三支别，横江一苇从。\n断堤方舍筏，山寺忽鸣钟。\n飞雾翳寒日，残烟隔暮舂。\n间关犹未远，离绪已重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":379,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出刘庵晚步望江南诸山有感寄同社诸丈","author":"洪恩","text":"荒原无历览，直视但丘陵。\n斥鴳飞盈步，波臣水仅升。\n莽烟孤晚岫，疏树出寒灯。\n目断钟山色，空馀望里登。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":380,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过即事 其一","author":"洪恩","text":"一雨山如沐，垂藤覆深屋。\n不见踏花人，窗外生新绿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":381,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过即事 其二","author":"洪恩","text":"朝起自凭栏，明霞灿如绮。\n失却向时人，鸟声似它语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":382,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游般若寺","author":"洪恩","text":"蟠纡垂鸟道，苍翠削芙蓉。\n坐可依危石，行将驻短筇。\n寒深千片竹，霜老一枝松。\n甃草枯残水，空潭已化龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":383,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松寥阁与堪公夜坐看月晨起值花朝连春分纪事同赠","author":"洪恩","text":"自赴已公招，清言破寂寥。\n茶全烹谷雨，春半及花朝。\n薄雾笼寒月，微风上夜潮。\n不知峰顶雪，还待几时消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":384,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王百谷虎丘送别","author":"洪恩","text":"林栖同倦鸟，山寺晚钟残。\n霜涸秋潭冷，风疏夜磬寒。\n榻方悬半偈，锡更指长干。\n尝就浮丘听，难禁别鹤弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":385,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒋墅晓行","author":"洪恩","text":"晓发渡金坛，星疏月未残。\n三峰如句曲，百折似严滩。\n村杵和霜下，渔灯隔雾看。\n吴歈多苦调，并入橹声寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":386,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送信公还豫章分得十五咸","author":"洪恩","text":"朔风迎溯水，吹雪上寒岩。\n怅别应千结，封题只半函。\n香垆烟渐敛，湖口月初衔。\n遥想章江外，钟声落夜帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":387,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄武氏园居即事","author":"洪恩","text":"雨后微风不度池，柳条犹拂镜中丝。\n凭阑只与禽鱼共，水底月明方自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":388,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经衲头庵忆法秀禅师","author":"洪恩","text":"绽衲居无定，双林一岭分。\n磬声和断续，香霭逗氤氲。\n石径连疏竹，溪流隔片云。\n丹书征出处，已是不逢君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山房送郭次甫之焦山","author":"洪恩","text":"雪后回仙棹，空堂别思盈。\n一尊留夜色，片语进寒更。\n茗熟松风细，梅香露气清。\n明朝江上月，去住总含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过耶溪法友新居","author":"洪恩","text":"径随阡陌转，篱抱小桥湾。\n有竹全临水，无氛可类山。\n鸟常窥户静，云似学僧闲。\n何事探灵秘，区中是大还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见源来自越一雨巢松来自吴同过松寥阁赋此示之","author":"洪恩","text":"得地江山胜，时当秋气深。\n虽从吴越至，何间去来心。\n日落尔时现，潮生如是音。\n楼台面水月，处处足登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋日问主人病","author":"洪恩","text":"十日佳期约，山园半亩宫。\n雨收残暑尽，月出大江空。\n背屋一亭竹，当门几树桐。\n我来怜病病，数问主人翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中西泠与明宗话别","author":"洪恩","text":"一经谈北坞，片语别西泠。\n香刹朝朝共，云山处处登。\n笠分千树雪，船刺半湖冰。\n会尽庭前话，今然不夜灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古松法友诵经水西园赋赠","author":"洪恩","text":"随意寄招提，名园自水西。\n托松临古涧，将鸟学卑栖。\n辨字追龙篆，探微得马蹄。\n遍游华藏界，还与一尘齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":395,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过荪谷访石公","author":"洪恩","text":"盘溪曲磴趁欹斜，行尽芳荪始见家。\n门外空多万岩壑，笥中不满一袈裟。\n经年石濑常疑雨，每日林香未辨花。\n此处白云红树好，休容车马破烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":396,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭山人舍宅","author":"洪恩","text":"疏竹高梧种始成，斗坛新出梵音声。\n山衔落照和云下，雾断寒潮隔岸鸣。\n石上旧题贞白字，井边犹勒葛洪名。\n他时猿鹤如相忆，只尺巢居一苇轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":397,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过吴氏经阁","author":"洪恩","text":"谁向空门学布金，新开龙藏树祇林。\n衣裁薜荔头陀制，人类莲花不染心。\n幡影到溪成梵字，经声出阁总潮音。\n氤氲细细灵香散，识得诸天莫外寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":398,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其一","author":"洪恩","text":"乱石砌成茅屋，编柴夹就疏篱。\n绳枢筚门昼掩，任教雾锁风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":399,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其二","author":"洪恩","text":"两石即为环堵，栋梁四五松柴。\n尽可容身炊爨，何须分外安排。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":400,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其三","author":"洪恩","text":"风雨杳无人至，开门静里生涯。\n诗字蒲团经卷，烧香汲水烹茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":401,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其四","author":"洪恩","text":"新苫尖头茅草，飒然骤雨斜风。\n夜半衣单漏湿，接来瓶钵西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":402,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其五","author":"洪恩","text":"饭罢梯云步石，跏趺草坐谈经。\n即非微尘世界，虚空木叶齐听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":403,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其六","author":"洪恩","text":"定起一声清磬，经行几转云堂。\n课毕篝灯松火，摘来柏叶生香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":404,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冶父山居七首 其七","author":"洪恩","text":"食至三声鼓响，茶来半点经圆。\n四众和云散去，只留明月阶前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":405,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月十五日冶父山中有怀方丈庵","author":"洪恩","text":"东岭初升皓月，西林渐敛残霞。\n散步归寻边笋，乘凉摘到新茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":406,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望亭饭僧作 其一","author":"洪恩","text":"借得人家隙地，中藏几树梅花。\n旋构数间茅屋，欲谈一卷《楞伽》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":407,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望亭饭僧作 其三","author":"洪恩","text":"屋后一湾流水，门前几点青山。\n云去月来桥上，鸟啼花落林间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":408,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望亭饭僧作 其四","author":"洪恩","text":"添得一条略彴，如从画里行来。\n即此草庵亦可，何须百尺楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祗树庵","author":"洪恩","text":"竹映窗前水漱门，数声幽鸟报朝昏。\n行来恐踏苔痕破，目送山云过远村。\n新植寒梅匝杏开，遍寻兰蕙绕篱栽。\n香风吹落梨花雪，蜂蝶纷纷间错来。\n山气笼从晓出云，一溪流水望中分。\n岩花树树红相映，竹里横拖白练裙。\n堪笑经年老蠹鱼，编编钻透未知书。\n忽然眉底开双眼，始信从前不识渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻莺送秀实还槜李","author":"洪恩","text":"雪覆岩眉涧有声，雾来雾去识阴晴。\n花开花落山如旧，添得黄鹂绾别情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饭罢闲行","author":"洪恩","text":"思量何幸得为僧，住倚诸天最上层。\n饭罢闲行临水石，碧桃花下坐传灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠隐峰老师","author":"洪恩","text":"一室千峰隐，霜颅半世空。\n潮音生海月，铃语报天风。\n垂老身能健，安贫气益雄。\n翻怜门外子，朝暮在途中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴仲穆","author":"洪恩","text":"入郭门通水，君家水映门。\n里中高士卧，河上丈人尊。\n不请月当户，自生花满园。\n豆蓬时散影，此际共谁言？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿石湖口","author":"洪恩","text":"野泊湖汀岸草萋，楞伽寺里问禅栖。\n西岩缘壁人初定，北岫开林鸟乱啼。\n微雨凌波纹转细，长风吹核物堪齐。\n只今箭径横塘水，还过吴宫与越溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山得焦弱侯书有感","author":"李贽","text":"海内存知己，天涯若比邻。\n古人聊自遣，此语总非真。\n学问多奇字，观书少斫轮。\n何时策杖屦，共醉秣陵春？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨眉仙人寄昆岑诗五首 其一","author":"万世尊","text":"谪向人间仅一周，而今限满恐难留。\n清虚有约无相负，好觅当年范蠡舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨眉仙人寄昆岑诗五首 其二","author":"万世尊","text":"业风吹破进贤冠，生死关头著脚难。\n六百年来今一遇，莫将大事等闲看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨眉仙人寄昆岑诗五首 其三","author":"万世尊","text":"浪游生死岂男儿，教外真传别有师。\n富贵神仙君两得，尚牵缰锁恋狂痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨眉仙人寄昆岑诗五首 其四","author":"万世尊","text":"难将蟒玉拒无常，勋业终归上一方。\n欲问后来神妙处，碧天齐拥紫金光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨眉仙人寄昆岑诗五首 其五","author":"万世尊","text":"颁来法旨不容违，仙律森严敢泄机。\n楚水吴山相共聚，与君同跨片霞飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日登高有感寄怀虞山钱太史","author":"幼朔","text":"落木萧萧两鬓皤，登高纵览旧关河。\n漫嗟鱼服英雄老，烂醉龙山感概多。\n千古风流吹帽尽，百年时序插萸过。\n石函君已镌名久，有约龙沙共放歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛首山阅楞严夜坐","author":"殷迈","text":"一轴《楞严》阅未终，四山风静暮林空。\n忽逢华屋身能入，自得神珠道不穷。\n树影欲迷云度处，经声遥听月明中。\n共传鹿鸟春深后，犹向烟萝礼法融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病怀","author":"殷迈","text":"城阙秋生爽气还，空堂木榻对衰颜。\n帘前花落常疑雨，树里云过忽见山。\n朝隐暂随朱绂后，心斋时住白云间。\n湖南草绿浮鸥净，爱尔忘机尽日闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴","author":"殷迈","text":"出自天台路，红英杂碧萝。\n忽逢绿发翁，问子将谁何？\n杖策人间世，索处恐蹉跎。\n老翁笑而去，林空山鸟歌。\n劝子且休矣，前途豺虎多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月六日避暑佛殿读书","author":"殷迈","text":"独抱遗经坐上方，诸天风度葛衣凉。\n蝉鸣草树半山静，松落云花合殿香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吉山寺僧漫尔自述","author":"殷迈","text":"迢遥吉山隈，林端见乔木。\n齐梁有古寺，绀宇构岩麓。\n朝梵发孤烟，暮禅响幽瀑。\n渌水带长川，青芜暗平陆。\n上人隐云门，披缁谢纨縠。\n心同野鹤远，身与孤峰独。\n跏趺一松下，四壁藤萝覆。\n十月高秋天，清霜粲篱菊。\n问之年八十，颜色如膏沐。\n布袍方掩形，清斋但莼蔌。\n食力自荷锄，盈畴种秫菽。\n隔屿杂芳花，缘溪环密竹。\n时有高人往，谈经龙虎伏。\n落日洗钵归，飞鸟自与逐。\n世情复何有，清净聊自淑。\n我本烟霞姿，幽栖爱林谷。\n抱疴增简慵，忘机侣猿鹿。\n每从野衲游，时向名兰宿。\n萧条长白寺，十年厌齑粥。\n旷然绝缘想，道心中夜肃。\n清晨简《楞严》，披衣窗下读。\n从闻悟无生，心空神自复。\n一从绾缨组，驰驱南北毂。\n人事有将迎，劳生空蹙蹜。\n念兹感夙心，静观中自恧。\n何如解尘鞅，归来结茅屋。\n杖策泉石间，相从参一六。\n年华不可返，达穷何足卜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将赴都门过天界方丈别山舟觉义","author":"殷迈","text":"春来抱病淹行色，每到山中兴便长。\n云护石床僧在定，月明台殿草飞香。\n烟霞暂别三千里，萍水俄惊二十霜。\n欲了无生齐出处，愿从淮老问真常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"抱病屏迹人事颇废乡人有以简礼见责者聊以解嘲","author":"殷迈","text":"衰迟犹苦病侵凌，筋力徇人愧不能。\n万事逢迎浑似梦，十年栖息只如僧。\n闲来烟篆留松月，定起蒲团映佛灯。\n尘世马牛从尔唤，太虚谁识本无称。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕友人过城南僧舍","author":"殷迈","text":"江湖嬴得自由身，杖履闲过鹿苑频。\n白首更亲童稚侣，青山偏恋薄能人。\n花宫云气香林满，草径藤萝石涧新。\n凡虑歇来真乐见，无人识得子渊贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧天竺造经还蜀 其一","author":"殷迈","text":"手持贝叶下沧洲，千部琅函是度舟。\n应有鱼龙护方广，锦江春色镜光浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]